+===== arc progress start --help =====
+Start a series: write a `progress` artifact and declare its items
+
+Prints the series' filename, one line per declared item with its id, and last the `arc begin` call that links a change to an item as the change opens. Items declared here are the start that later edits are counted from. A series needs no plan; `--follows` records the plan it follows when there is one.
