+Usage: arc progress start [OPTIONS] --title <TITLE> <TOPIC>
+
+Arguments:
+  <TOPIC>
+          Kebab-case topic slug
+
+Options:
+      --actor <ACTOR>
+          Acting identity; see `arc guide identity-options`
+
+      --title <TITLE>
+          The series' title
+
+      --follows <FOLLOWS>
+          The plan artifact this series follows, by its bare filename in this journal
+
+      --harness <HARNESS>
+          Acting harness; see `arc guide identity-options`
+          
+          [env: ARC_HARNESS]
+
+      --item <ITEMS>
+          An item's title; repeat once per item, in order
+
+      --session <SESSION>
+          Native acting session; see `arc guide identity-options`
+          
+          [env: ARC_SESSION]
+
+      --from <FROM>
+          Bind a declared item to its originating journal artifact (`<item>=<file>` such as `i1=2026...todo.md`, or `<file>` when one item is declared; cross-project as `<project>::<file>`)
+
+      --session-link <SESSION_LINK>
+          Private acting-session link; see `arc guide identity-options`
+          
+          [env: ARC_SESSION_LINK]
+
+      --gated-waves
+          Declare waves as barriers by default (earlier waves must finish before items in later waves become ready)
+
+      --model <MODEL>
+          Declared model and effort; see `arc guide identity-options`
